      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Item 5:</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="padding-left:4.5pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">There are no bundled sales and transportation volumes included on page 520.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:10pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Item 9:</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="padding-left:22.5pt;text-indent:-18pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">1)</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.11pt">None of the system supply gas that is stored is reported as sales, transportation or compression volumes.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="padding-left:22.5pt;text-indent:-18pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">2)</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.11pt">There is no intent to sell or transport system supply volumes that are stored.</span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="padding-left:22.5pt;text-indent:-18pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">3)</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:9.11pt">The contract storage volumes at the end of the period were 27,345,299 Dth.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-8" id="fn-8" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:25pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Schedule Page: 521-M1 Line No.: 7 Column: e</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> 
          <br/>Volumes are allocated between Discounted, Negotiated and Recourse rate based upon the throughput delivered rate type excluding volumes delivered on the North Badlands and Round Prairie sub-systems.
          <br/>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-9" id="fn-9" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:25pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Schedule Page: 521-M2 Line No.: 7 Column: e</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> 
          <br/>Volumes are allocated between Discounted, Negotiated and Recourse rate based upon the throughput delivered rate type excluding volumes delivered on the North Badlands and Round Prairie sub-systems.
          <br/>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-10" id="fn-10" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:25pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Schedule Page: 521-M3 Line No.: 7 Column: e</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> 
          <br/>Volumes are allocated between Discounted, Negotiated and Recourse rate based upon the throughput delivered rate type excluding volumes delivered on the North Badlands and Round Prairie sub-systems.
          <br/>
          <br/>
        </span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-11" id="fn-11" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:25pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Schedule Page: 521-M1 Line No.: 4 Column: i</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> 
          <br/>Shipper Supplied Gas is not directly charged to an account. As directed under FERC Order No. 581, any excess or deficiency in net Shipper Supplied Gas is recorded as "Other Regulatory Assets/Liabilities" (Accounts 182.3/254) with offsetting entries booked to "Regulatory Debits/Credits" (Accounts 407.3/407.4).
        </span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-12" id="fn-12" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:10pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Schedule Page: 521-M1 Line No.: 11 Column: i</span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"> 
          <br/>Gas Used for Compressor Station Fuel is valued based upon CIG Index as published in Gas Daily.
        </span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-13" id="fn-13" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:10pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Schedule Page: 521-M1 Line No.: 18 Column: i
          <br/>
        </span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Gas Used for Other Deliveries and Operations is valued based upon CIG Index as published in Gas Daily.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-14" id="fn-14" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:10pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Schedule Page: 521-M1 Line No.: 26 Column: i
          <br/>
        </span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Gas Lost and Unaccounted For is valued based upon CIG Index as published in Gas Daily.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-15" id="fn-15" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:10pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:120%">Schedule Page: 521-M1 Line No.: 34 Column: i
          <br/>
        </span>
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Net Excess or (Deficiency) balances are refunded or collected in-kind through WBI Energy Transmission's annual Fuel and Electric Power Reimbursement Adjustment Provision pursuant to Section 37 of the General Terms and Conditions of the Tariff.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-16" id="fn-16" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Post-retirement liability adjustments.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-17" id="fn-17" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Pursuant to WBI Energy Transmission's Balancing and Nomination Variance Procedures in Section 14 and Unauthorized Gas in Section 17 of the General Terms and Conditions of its Tariff.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-18" id="fn-18" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Pursuant to WBI Energy Transmission's Fuel &amp; Electric Power Reimbursement Adjustment Provision in Section 35 of the General Terms and Conditions of its Tariff.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-19" id="fn-19" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Pursuant to WBI Energy Transmission's Balancing and Nomination Variance Procedures in Section 14 of the General Terms and Conditions of its Tariff.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-20" id="fn-20" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents gas withdrawn from company owned storage.</link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-21" id="fn-21" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">Represents gas injected into company owned storage.</link:footnote>
